{"baseTypeIndex":5,"blankCount":1,"difficulty":5,"exerciseID":"615f961953170f0f07243d24","exerciseType":"writeout","gradeIndex":8,"gradeLevel":"","gradeName":"八年级","optCount":4,"queAns":"(1)>，>， = (2) $m+n\\geq2\\sqrt{mn}$  (3)40","queCtlgs":[{"catalogId":"5eccb357518ec3c65e1e9168","queId":"615f961953170f0f07243d24","schCode":"3013","textbookId":"5ecc92f2518ec3c65e1e9137"}],"question":"(1)用“=”、“>”、“<”填空：4+3             $2\\sqrt{4\\times3}\\;$ ， $1+\\frac16$              $2\\sqrt{1\\times\\frac16}$  ，5+5             $2\\sqrt{5\\times5\\;}$ ． (2)由(1)中各式猜想m+n 与 $2\\sqrt{mn}$ (m≥0, n≥0)的大小，并给出证明． (3)请利用上述结论解决下面问题： 某设计师要对园林的一个区域进行设计改造，将该区域用篱笆围成矩形的花圃．如图所示， 花圃恰好可以借用一段墙体，为了围成面积为 200m<sup>2</sup> 的花圃，所用的篱笆至少需要多少米? <img src=\"https://v3.rawstonedu.net/fs/repo/615fce1aa1e157c7d1180d7b.png\">","solution":"(2) $m+n\\geq2\\sqrt{mn}$ ．理由如下： 当m≥0，n≥0 时， ∵<img src=\"https://v3.rawstonedu.net/fs/repo/615fd1a3a1e157c7d1180d82.png\">≥0 ， ∴<img src=\"https://v3.rawstonedu.net/fs/repo/615fd1aca1e157c7d1180d83.png\">≥0 ， ∴<img src=\"https://v3.rawstonedu.net/fs/repo/615fd194a1e157c7d1180d81.png\">≥0 ， ∴ $m+n\\geq2\\sqrt{mn}$ ． (3)花圃的长为a米，宽为b米，则 a>0 ，b>0 ， S=ab=200 ， 根据(2)的结论可得： a+2b≥<img src=\"https://v3.rawstonedu.net/fs/repo/615fd152b8a0fc30831805ef.png\">=<img src=\"https://v3.rawstonedu.net/fs/repo/615fd15da1e157c7d1180d80.png\">=40， ∴篱笆至少需要 40 米","subQueNum":0,"subQues":[],"subjectCategory":"math","tags":[{"coreFlag":0,"examPointFlag":1,"knowId":"5eb8faeaeb16623401484019","knowName":"实数的大小比较","knowTypeId":"5d424a75a7cbaf0014c9df23","knowTypeName":"题型","lastExamPointFlag":0,"priority":2,"queId":"615f961953170f0f07243d24","sortIndex":92},{"coreFlag":0,"examPointFlag":1,"knowId":"5eec8925a2ee7a4a9ef011a8","knowName":"新公式应用问题","knowTypeId":"5d424a75a7cbaf0014c9df23","knowTypeName":"题型","lastExamPointFlag":1,"priority":2,"queId":"615f961953170f0f07243d24","sortIndex":135}]}